@name     freq_mod_mode
@alias    FF
@group    osc
@c_name   skode_clause_freq_mod_mode
@type     realtime
@arity    1
@match    (finite)
@summary  frequency modulation routing mode
@doc
Sets FM routing mode (0:linear FM, 1:phase modulation style, etc.).
Usage: FF mode (or freq_mod_mode mode)
@code
    if (voice < 0 || voice >= synth_config.voice_max) return -1;
    return freq_mod_mode_set(voice, (int)args[0]);
@end
